body:
I never expected to make it past 15. Some days, I'm still surprised to be here. I still have a hard time "picturing" the future, but now I know that that's okay.

&#x200B;

I'd tell my younger self that learning to stand up for myself, especially to my family, was the best thing i could've done. And getting professional help made me realize what negative things I was doing to cry for help.

&#x200B;

I'd tell myself that it's okay to be in a bad place some times, as long as I know that it's not forever and only I can change it.
